{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118197","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118197/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118197/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118197/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118197","id":4205456538,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7P-f6U","number":118197,"title":"Jolt: Update `RigidBody3D` environmental properties more appropriately","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-04-04T17:48:30Z","updated_at":"2026-06-13T06:55:10Z","closed_at":"2026-04-06T18:07:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118197","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118197","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118197.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118197.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-06T18:07:07Z"},"body":"Fixes #108715.\r\nFixes #118193.\r\n\r\nThe main purpose of this change is to:\r\n\r\n- Actually propagate runtime damping changes from `Area3D` to any overlapping `RigidBody3D` correctly.\r\n- Stop changes in area overlaps from waking the `RigidBody3D` up if there isn't actually a change in total gravity as a result.\r\n\r\nThis happens to also fix:\r\n\r\n- A body's total gravity likely being stale on the first physics frame after a `RigidBody3D` has had area overlaps added/removed, as we weren't updating its total gravity until the next physics step.\r\n- A body likely always starting out as awake due to `JoltBody3D::_space_changed()` always calling `_areas_changed()` which in turn called `wake_up()`. Now instead we call `_areas_changed()` in `_exit_all_areas()`, which serves the same purpose. This fix really only applies to custom `PhysicsServer3D` bodies though, as `RigidBody3D` suffers from this problem for other reasons anyway.\r\n- A body being saved out with stale total gravity/damping when leaving a physics space while overlapping areas. This caused no problems in practice, since they would previously have been updated immediately when put into another physics space anyway, but it's arguably more correct now.\r\n\r\nI've also thrown in refactoring that:\r\n\r\n- Combines the `_update_gravity` and `_update_damp` methods into `_update_environmental_properties`, so we don't have to loop the areas twice.\r\n- Stops passing `JPH::Body&` from `JoltSpace3D::_pre_step` into `JoltObject3D::pre_step` (and any method it forwards it to) since we already have `JoltObject3D::jolt_body` these days.\r\n- Renames `JoltBody3D::gravity` to `JoltBody3D::total_gravity`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118197/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118197/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}